rows.original:
[var0
    |"[pc.isBimbo
        |Bye-bye Ahmri! I'll see you later![aster.around
            | You too [aster.name]! Blow Mommy a big kiss!
        ]"
        |Stay out of trouble here. I'll be back[aster.around
            |. You stay safe too, little buddy!
            |,
        ]"
    ] you say as you leave Ahmri [aster.around
        |and [aster.name] alone together.
        |to her lonesome.
    ] She gives you a warm smile and waves, blowing you a goodbye kiss as you head for the door.
    |[aster.around
        |"[pc.mf
            |B-ba
            |M-ma
        ]!?" [aster.name] says, his voice etched with confusion as he watches you leave so suddenly after arriving. You turn to see him looking at you with concern, his lower lip trembling.

        "Sorry [pc.isBimbo
            |honey!
            |kiddo!
        ] I forgot something I had to do. [pc.mf
            |Daddy
            |Mommy
        ] definitely loves you bunches, though," you say, turning back and striding over to scoop him up into a hug. He giggles, worries banished.

        "Oki... Luv you," he says, turning and hugging you around the head. You give him a smooch on the tummy before setting him down. 

        You stride over and give Ahmri a goodbye kiss before she can protest about also being ignored, and then leave while waving to both of them.
        |"Huh, wha?" Ahmri asks, utterly perplexed as you turn and head back out the way you came.
    ]
]

rows.translation:
[var0
            |"[pc.isBimbo
                |再见啊姆里！回头见！[aster.around
                    | 你也是。 [aster.name]给妈妈一个大大的吻吧！
                ]"
                |在这里别惹麻烦，我马上回来。[aster.around
                    |小家伙，你也要注意安全哦！
                    |,
                ]"
            ] 你走的时候再说了吧，阿姆里。 [aster.around
                |以及 [aster.name] 独自一人。
                |独自一人。
            ] 她向你投来温暖的微笑，挥手道别，而在你走向门口时，她还轻轻吻了你一下，作为告别。
            |[aster.around
                |"[pc.mf
                    |巴……
                    |妈……
                ]!?" [aster.name] 对不起，”他说，声音中带着困惑，看着你刚到不久就突然离开。你回头，看到他正担忧地望着你，下唇微微颤抖着。 [pc.isBimbo
                    |亲爱的！
                    |小家伙！
                ] 我忘记了自己本来要做的事情。 [pc.mf
                    |爸爸
                    |妈妈
                ] 其实我真的很喜欢你们呢，”你说道，转身走过去将他抱在怀里。他咯咯笑了起来，所有的担忧都烟消云散了。

“好吧……我也爱你，”他说着，转过身来抱住了你的头。你在他的肚子上亲了一下，然后才把他放下来。

你快步走到阿姆丽跟前，在她还没来得及抱怨自己也被忽视之前，给了她一个吻，然后挥手向他们俩告别，离开了那里。
                |哈？什么？”阿姆里完全搞糊涂了，而你则转身，沿着来时的路走了回去。
            ]
        ]

rows.original:
"What would you like to do? I know all the places, but I guess you might not. There's lots of good food, but there's also sightseeing, or places to relax," Ahmri asks, looking at you expectantly. [aster.around
    |"I can stop by Nova's place to drop off [aster.name] before we head out!"
]

rows.translation:
你想做什么呢？这些地方我都很熟悉，但我想你可能不太了解。这里有很多好吃的美食，也可以去观光，或者找一些地方放松放松。”阿姆里期待地看着你，问道。 [aster.around
            |我可以顺路去诺娃家把东西送过去。 [aster.name] 在我们出发之前！
        ]

rows.original:
The two of you help each other wipe up and get clean, and then you're back to hanging around the chieftain's hut and helping Ahmri with chores. [aster.around
    |Aster returns after a while as well, tired out from playing but not quite ready for a nap.
] You're left to decide what to do at your leisure.

rows.translation:
你们两个互相帮忙打扫卫生，弄干净自己，然后就可以回到酋长的小屋里，帮阿姆里做些家务活了。 [aster.around
            |过了一会儿，阿斯特也回来了，玩得有些累了，但还不想马上睡觉。
        ] 你可以根据自己的安排来决定该做什么。
